<title>UK: Waddington chairman David Perry to retire.</title>
<headline>Waddington chairman David Perry to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British packaging and specialist printing firm Waddington Plc said on Monday that chairman David Perry would retire at the company's annual meeting on July 25.</p>
<p>The company said J.C. (Michael) Orr would join the board as a non-executive director on April 2, with a view to succeeding Perry as chairman after the AGM.</p>
<p>Orr is currently chairman of Molins Plc, Waddington said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
